	"img": "systems/a5e/assets/Armbands_of_the_Sun.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>These armbands are made of fabric wrappings trimmed in thin red rope that go around the forearms and tie off at the hand, between the thumb and forefinger. They have 3 charges. Before making a melee attack, you can expend one charge to change the damage type of your weapon to radiant, and deal an additional 1d4 radiant damage.</p><p>The armbands recover 1d4-1 charges per day. If the recharge roll totals to 0, no charges are recovered for that day, but a new roll can be done the following day as normal.</p>",
